  introLines:
  - Here are your work trials for this career.
  - Each button opens a different mini-game.
  - Complete the trials to practice job language in context.
  - Dialogues offer crucial instructions. Read and be careful!
  - Tap a trial when you are ready!
  introGate: {fileID: 0}
