--- !u!114 &1815899109
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1815899105}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3049d8cb5bb216d4a80d8ea1c270fbc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  introController: {fileID: 1815899107}
  lawyerLines:
  - This is the lawyer trial menu.
  - Here you will practice legal vocabulary and courtroom - style tasks.
  - Choose one trial and focus on the meaning of the terms, not only the words themselves.
  - When you finish all three, you will have explored the full lawyer path!
  chefLines:
  - This is the cook trial menu.
  - Here you will practice kitchen vocabulary, instructions and work terms used in
    food preparation.
  - Choose one trial and pay attention to tools, actions and food-related language.
  - Finish all three to complete the cook path!
  surgeonLines:
  - This is the doctor trial menu.
  - Here you will practice medical vocabulary, object recognition, and instruction
    - based work tasks.
  - Read the dialogues and instructions carefully before you act.
  - Finish all three to complete the doctor path!
  achieverLines:
  - Because you are goal-oriented, you start with the easiest work-trial and progress
    towards the harder ones.
  explorerLines:
  - Because you are discovery-oriented, you roam around looking for work-trials.
  socializerLines:
  - Because you are people-oriented, pay close attention to further dialogue and
    instructions from your superior.
  killerLines:
  - Because you are result-oriented, you will have a limited time and different scoring
    for each question and work-trial.
  fallbackLines:
  - Choose one trial to begin.
  - Each one teaches job language through a different task.
